UNESCO Institute for Statistics (UIS) Bulk Data Download Service snapshots
in this directory — including zip archives, extracted CSV, and API fallback
JSON — are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 IGO
(CC BY-SA 3.0 IGO):

https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/igo/

These files are isolated from the rest of the Geo Index repository so that
ShareAlike obligations do not apply to original Geo Index source code (MIT)
or first-party editorial copy (CC BY 4.0). Do not copy UIS commentary,
methodology prose, or other UIS narrative text into the site.

Derived numeric observations in data/generated/ are a compilation of facts.
Each valued UIS observation carries licenseId `cc-by-sa-3.0-igo`.
